{"c":[{"name":"20260903T020823Z-863b2cb139a2db13","text":"niko-core is the omnipresent baseline: do not strip it because a workflow restates the same idea. Progress Tracking stays out of niko-core — task lists are Niko-workflow only.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T163802Z-128a4d11c5b57281","text":"L4 preflight must dispatch on progress.md Complexity Level 4, not milestones.md presence: sub-runs keep milestones.md and still need the L2/L3 TDD bar.","type":"note"}]}
